Z||000009||chester||08-27-2001||09:57 PM||||On the trailer.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trip_9.JPG"> <P>Everybody say CHEEZE!  Me, Boomtastic, Fiero Johns dad and Fiero John<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trip_12.JPG"> <P>Leaving the state.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trip_13.JPG"> <P>We were tailgated all the way home!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trip_14.JPG"> <P>||||reg||7
