Z||000011||chester||08-27-2001||10:01 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88CoupeV6:<BR><B>Wow, Glad to hear you got it home safely    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> When are you inviting us up to look at it in person???    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Also we want pics.  Are you guys going to Marshfield Sunday, I hope to see you there.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hi Josh,<P>We'll probably have a cookout some time after Spindles.  I got some pics for you as well on the way.  Here you go.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/trip_15.JPG">  <P>And yup, we are planning on going to Spindles.  I hope a few others are too.  <P>Rob D.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by chester (edited 08-27-2001).]||||reg||1
