Z||000013||MsBeth||08-27-2001||11:07 PM||||What a great time we had  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I finally rolled into my driveway about 8:45 this morning.  It is now about 11pm and I am looking forward to some sleep in a real bed (I had to work all day today - ugh!).  I haven't had any real sleep since friday night- And Renee you aren't kidding ...we are getting too old for this - so when are we doing it again???  lol.  Thanks again guys it was a great time!  And so nice to meet John and his dad! Very nice folks! Maybe some day we'll see you both at the Dells?  You just never know.   <P>Pics look great! Thanks again Rob and Renee- you guys are the best!  (hey Renee - did you find the knife?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">)<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blue_2.gif"> <P>MsBeth||||reg||14
